1
00:00:14,458 --> 00:00:19,791
RADIOACTIVE EMERGENCY

2
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:27,540
Kami di sini untuk membicarakan
kecelakaan radiologik Goiânia.

3
00:00:27,541 --> 00:00:32,832
Saat mendengar berita,
kami mengadakan rapat untuk membahasnya.

4
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:36,374
<i>Kami tak senang</i>

5
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:39,957
<i>karena limbah itu
akan dikirim ke tanah kami.</i>

6
00:00:39,958 --> 00:00:44,249
<i>Sembilan puluh warga adat Kayapó pergi
ke Brasília untuk memprotes keputusan</i>

7
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:48,332
<i>yang menjadikan Serra do Cachimbo
tempat pembuangan limbah nuklir.</i>

8
00:00:48,333 --> 00:00:51,874
<i>Beberapa hal di alam tak boleh diganggu.
Biarkan saja.</i>

9
00:00:51,875 --> 00:00:56,624
<i>Jika tidak, alam akan menyerang,
memberontak, dan menyebabkan kehancuran.</i>

10
00:00:56,625 --> 00:00:58,332
<i>Mereka berasal dari Pará selatan</i>

11
00:00:58,333 --> 00:01:02,582
<i>dan takut limbah radioaktif Goiânia
bisa membahayakan 1.500 warga adat…</i>

12
00:01:02,583 --> 00:01:03,875
Mereka benar.

13
00:01:05,875 --> 00:01:08,582
Tong-tong itu mulai dipindahkan
minggu depan.

14
00:01:08,583 --> 00:01:12,290
Bantu aku menyiapkan kendaraan
ke Serra do Cachimbo.

15
00:01:12,291 --> 00:01:14,500
- Tapi, Roberto…
- Sebentar.

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:15,875
Ya?

17
00:01:17,166 --> 00:01:21,791
Tidak. Tak ada yang mau kubahas
dengan Gubernur Pará.

18
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,333
Baiklah. Sambungkan dia.

19
00:01:27,208 --> 00:01:28,083
Halo?

20
00:01:29,291 --> 00:01:33,040
Jelas tidak!
Limbah itu takkan tinggal di sini!

21
00:01:33,041 --> 00:01:35,041
Akan kulaporkan ini ke Presiden.

22
00:01:44,541 --> 00:01:48,791
Kita mulai perawatan barumu hari ini.
Kabar bagus, 'kan?

23
00:01:52,958 --> 00:01:56,958
Aku mendengar hal bagus tentangmu
di berita kemarin.

24
00:01:59,916 --> 00:02:01,458
Mereka bilang

25
00:02:02,666 --> 00:02:04,375
jika bukan karenamu…

26
00:02:06,416 --> 00:02:09,041
jauh lebih banyak orang
akan terkontaminasi.

27
00:02:13,666 --> 00:02:15,583
Dan itu benar, Bu Antônia.

28
00:02:18,833 --> 00:02:21,250
Kau pahlawan. Kau tahu itu?

29
00:02:28,958 --> 00:02:29,875
Sayang.

30
00:02:32,125 --> 00:02:34,458
Ayah mau menunjukkan sesuatu.

31
00:02:38,333 --> 00:02:41,000
Dokter sudah memberitahumu
soal putri raja.

32
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:42,833
Ayah…

33
00:02:44,083 --> 00:02:48,000
Ayah ingin menceritakan kisah seorang ratu

34
00:02:48,625 --> 00:02:51,750
yang memotong pendek rambutnya.

35
00:02:52,416 --> 00:02:53,791
Sama sepertimu, Sayang.

36
00:02:55,333 --> 00:02:57,333
Dan ratu cantik ini

37
00:02:58,291 --> 00:03:01,333
punya suara terindah di dunia.

38
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,665
<i>Jika kau tahu betapa aku menangis</i>

39
00:03:23,666 --> 00:03:26,666
<i>Dan betapa aku memohon</i>

40
00:03:29,291 --> 00:03:31,833
Ayah sangat menyayangimu, kau tahu?

41
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:36,000
Ayah sangat menyayangimu, Sayang.

42
00:03:40,291 --> 00:03:41,874
Nak, bisa dengar Ayah?

43
00:03:41,875 --> 00:03:43,999
Nak!

44
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,458
Nak?

45
00:03:46,833 --> 00:03:47,915
Antônia?

46
00:03:47,916 --> 00:03:49,291
Gawat!

47
00:03:50,083 --> 00:03:50,958
Celeste?

48
00:03:51,458 --> 00:03:52,333
Celeste…

49
00:03:54,083 --> 00:03:55,957
- Ada apa?
- Jantungnya berhenti!

50
00:03:55,958 --> 00:03:57,457
Pompa dadanya.

51
00:03:57,458 --> 00:03:58,750
Ambil <i>ambubag.</i> Cepat!

52
00:03:59,250 --> 00:04:00,915
Tolong! Siapa saja!

53
00:04:00,916 --> 00:04:02,750
Sayang.

54
00:04:03,625 --> 00:04:05,582
Ya ampun. Sayang…

55
00:04:05,583 --> 00:04:07,624
Tolong aku. Ya ampun!

56
00:04:07,625 --> 00:04:08,583
Periksa Celeste!

57
00:04:20,166 --> 00:04:27,166
USIR SESIUM
USIR CNEN

58
00:05:15,333 --> 00:05:16,500
Bu Catarina.

59
00:05:27,083 --> 00:05:28,541
Bu Catarina, kumohon.

60
00:06:00,500 --> 00:06:01,582
Turunkan.

61
00:06:01,583 --> 00:06:02,416
Ayo.

62
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:16,874
Meski CNEN dan pemerintah Goiás
telah menjamin

63
00:06:16,875 --> 00:06:21,249
jenazah Antônia Quadrado
dan Celeste dos Passos Quadrado

64
00:06:21,250 --> 00:06:24,749
tak menimbulkan risiko bagi publik,

65
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:27,457
unjuk rasa menyelimuti
Pemakaman Parque pagi ini…

66
00:06:27,458 --> 00:06:28,374
HARI KE-30

67
00:06:28,375 --> 00:06:32,583
selama pemakaman
korban tewas pertama sesium-137.

68
00:06:35,750 --> 00:06:37,874
Kami menolak mereka di sini!

69
00:06:37,875 --> 00:06:41,083
- Jangan makamkan di sini!
- Hargai orang mati kami!

70
00:06:41,666 --> 00:06:42,999
Pergi!

71
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,040
Jangan cemari tanah kami!

72
00:06:45,041 --> 00:06:47,999
- Pergi!
- Jangan makamkan mereka di sini!

73
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,415
TOLAK SESIUM!

74
00:06:49,416 --> 00:06:51,750
Pergi! Jangan di sini!

75
00:06:52,708 --> 00:06:55,165
Apa-apaan ini? Tenang!

76
00:06:55,166 --> 00:06:56,375
Hentikan ini!

77
00:06:57,250 --> 00:06:59,208
Jangan mendekat!

78
00:07:00,083 --> 00:07:02,083
Tiarap! Mereka melempar batu!

79
00:07:04,583 --> 00:07:05,958
Itu putriku!

80
00:07:08,458 --> 00:07:09,750
Tenang!

81
00:07:11,583 --> 00:07:14,124
- Mundur!
- Tolong hargai kami!

82
00:07:14,125 --> 00:07:15,916
- Hargai kami!
- Hentikan ini!

83
00:07:16,416 --> 00:07:18,458
Pergi!

84
00:07:19,416 --> 00:07:20,625
Pergi!

85
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,332
Pergi!

86
00:07:26,333 --> 00:07:29,916
- Pergi!
- Pergi!

87
00:07:39,458 --> 00:07:41,415
<i>Josias Machado Gomes.</i>

88
00:07:41,416 --> 00:07:45,416
<i>Penyebab kematian, gagal paru-paru,
pukul 14.00, 28 Oktober.</i>

89
00:07:49,708 --> 00:07:51,415
<i>Valêncio Freitas Soares.</i>

90
00:07:51,416 --> 00:07:56,791
<i>Penyebab kematian, edema paru akut,
pukul 19.45, 27 Oktober.</i>

91
00:07:57,875 --> 00:07:58,916
Buang napas.

92
00:08:01,458 --> 00:08:03,250
Bagaimana perasaanmu hari ini?

93
00:08:04,708 --> 00:08:06,791
Berat, Dok.

94
00:08:08,583 --> 00:08:11,000
Hidup sudah tak berarti.
Apa lagi yang bisa kulakukan?

95
00:08:19,916 --> 00:08:21,166
Bagaimana kabar João?

96
00:08:25,125 --> 00:08:26,291
Apa menurutmu

97
00:08:27,708 --> 00:08:29,208
kami bisa bicara?

98
00:08:30,833 --> 00:08:32,333
Biar kubahas

99
00:08:33,208 --> 00:08:35,041
masalah ini dengan dr. Eduardo.

100
00:08:37,791 --> 00:08:38,708
Dokter…

101
00:08:42,625 --> 00:08:46,416
kali terakhir aku mencoba
menjenguk Tininha,

102
00:08:48,083 --> 00:08:50,166
kau melarangku, dan sekarang dia…

103
00:08:55,416 --> 00:08:56,791
Akan aku usahakan.

104
00:08:58,125 --> 00:08:59,083
Permisi.

105
00:09:08,583 --> 00:09:10,000
Tarik napas dalam-dalam.

106
00:09:12,833 --> 00:09:14,583
Apa kau merasa pusing?

107
00:09:18,250 --> 00:09:19,833
Sulit bernapas?

108
00:09:20,916 --> 00:09:22,125
Ada nyeri dada?

109
00:09:24,583 --> 00:09:25,541
João?

110
00:09:26,041 --> 00:09:27,541
Terserahlah, Dok.

111
00:09:28,791 --> 00:09:29,958
Silakan berbaring.

112
00:09:31,541 --> 00:09:33,583
Bernapaslah. Tenang.

113
00:09:35,916 --> 00:09:37,124
Dengar, Carlos.

114
00:09:37,125 --> 00:09:40,583
Obat baru ini bertujuan memperkuat imunmu.

115
00:09:41,083 --> 00:09:44,332
Tapi semua upaya kami tak cukup
untuk menyembuhkan lenganmu.

116
00:09:44,333 --> 00:09:46,125
Ini mengarah ke nekrosis.

117
00:09:47,333 --> 00:09:49,000
Bicara dengan bahasaku, Dok.

118
00:09:50,458 --> 00:09:52,416
Mungkin perlu dilakukan amputasi.

119
00:09:52,916 --> 00:09:54,500
Itu bisa menyelamatkan nyawamu.

120
00:09:57,375 --> 00:09:58,208
<i>Jadi,</i>

121
00:09:59,833 --> 00:10:01,583
Carlos mengalami hipotermia.

122
00:10:03,333 --> 00:10:05,665
João mengalami edema paru.

123
00:10:05,666 --> 00:10:08,333
Tepat setelah kita mulai memberikan CSF.

124
00:10:09,875 --> 00:10:10,875
Kebetulan?

125
00:10:13,625 --> 00:10:15,832
Perawatan ini berisiko.

126
00:10:15,833 --> 00:10:18,540
Kita kehilangan Josias dan Valêncio
setelah penyuntikan.

127
00:10:18,541 --> 00:10:19,666
Sebentar!

128
00:10:20,541 --> 00:10:22,457
Setelah empat hari penyuntikan.

129
00:10:22,458 --> 00:10:25,249
Keduanya meninggal
karena <i>Klebsiella</i> resistan

130
00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:28,040
yang sudah mereka derita
sebelum kita memulai

131
00:10:28,041 --> 00:10:29,708
perawatan eksperimental ini.

132
00:10:30,208 --> 00:10:32,707
Lúcio, Nina, dan Evenildo
menunjukkan kemajuan.

133
00:10:32,708 --> 00:10:33,999
Itu bukan kemajuan.

134
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:36,541
Bagaimanapun, kita tak boleh salah.

135
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:42,207
Jika kita hentikan CSF
dan kondisi Carlos memburuk,

136
00:10:42,208 --> 00:10:43,916
infeksi lengannya bisa membunuhnya.

137
00:10:46,125 --> 00:10:48,874
Tapi jika kita teruskan
dan demam itu karena perawatan ini,

138
00:10:48,875 --> 00:10:50,000
dia juga bisa mati.

139
00:10:51,208 --> 00:10:52,041
Ya.

140
00:10:53,291 --> 00:10:56,791
RUMAH SAKIT UMUM GOIÂNIA

141
00:11:01,208 --> 00:11:02,291
Hei, Nak.

142
00:11:04,625 --> 00:11:06,958
Kau baik? Mau bicara dengan pamanmu?

143
00:11:09,458 --> 00:11:12,415
- Raimundo bilang kondisi João memburuk.
- João?

144
00:11:12,416 --> 00:11:15,541
Apa? Kau memanggil ayahmu
dengan namanya sekarang?

145
00:11:16,458 --> 00:11:17,875
Jangan ganggu aku.

146
00:11:33,041 --> 00:11:35,249
Anak itu takkan menghargaimu

147
00:11:35,250 --> 00:11:38,165
jika kau terus tunduk
pada setiap dokter yang datang.

148
00:11:38,166 --> 00:11:39,957
Dia hanya sedang marah pada dunia.

149
00:11:39,958 --> 00:11:41,000
Kau tidak?

150
00:11:45,958 --> 00:11:47,666
Claudinei itu pintar, Darlei.

151
00:11:49,708 --> 00:11:51,458
Dia marah pada João karena

152
00:11:52,708 --> 00:11:55,750
jika terjadi sesuatu padanya juga,
rasanya takkan terlalu sakit.

153
00:11:57,750 --> 00:12:01,666
Ada orang yang memilih hidup sendiri
agar tak perlu merasa kehilangan.

154
00:12:12,750 --> 00:12:14,124
Hei, Márcio!

155
00:12:14,125 --> 00:12:15,125
Hei, Nak.

156
00:12:15,958 --> 00:12:16,875
Nak.

157
00:12:19,083 --> 00:12:20,250
Anakku.

158
00:12:24,250 --> 00:12:27,832
Astaga. Kau yakin sudah baik-baik saja
untuk pulang, Nak?

159
00:12:27,833 --> 00:12:30,290
- Ya, Ayah. Dokter mengizinkanku pulang.
- Tapi…

160
00:12:30,291 --> 00:12:32,708
Bisa bawa aku ke Dinkes?

161
00:12:33,208 --> 00:12:35,250
Tapi… Márcio.

162
00:12:36,583 --> 00:12:38,708
Kau akan bekerja
meski kondisimu seburuk ini?

163
00:12:39,333 --> 00:12:40,291
Masuklah.

164
00:12:40,916 --> 00:12:42,666
Apa kau gila?

165
00:12:43,166 --> 00:12:44,000
Dengar.

166
00:12:44,541 --> 00:12:46,124
- Kita…
- Ke Dinkes.

167
00:12:46,125 --> 00:12:49,457
- Tidak!
- Apa aku harus selalu menjelaskan ini?

168
00:12:49,458 --> 00:12:52,207
Jika tak ada regulasi limbah nuklir
di Brasil,

169
00:12:52,208 --> 00:12:54,082
jangan harap Goiás mau jadi korban.

170
00:12:54,083 --> 00:12:56,041
Tong-tong ini harus disingkirkan.

171
00:12:56,541 --> 00:12:58,165
Orang-orang ketakutan.

172
00:12:58,166 --> 00:13:01,915
Ini situasi darurat
yang butuh tindakan cepat.

173
00:13:01,916 --> 00:13:05,499
Membangun tempat penyimpanan tong
di Abadia de Goiás adalah…

174
00:13:05,500 --> 00:13:08,415
Kau mau menceramahiku
soal administrasi publik?

175
00:13:08,416 --> 00:13:12,790
Aku sudah membuat komitmen publik
untuk menyingkirkan tong-tong ini.

176
00:13:12,791 --> 00:13:14,541
Takkan tinggal kecuali aku dipaksa.

177
00:13:18,708 --> 00:13:20,500
Kalau begitu, kami akan paksa.

178
00:13:21,291 --> 00:13:23,874
- Apa?
- Apa maksudmu, Beny?

179
00:13:23,875 --> 00:13:27,915
Kau sendiri bilang
belum ada regulasi yang berlaku.

180
00:13:27,916 --> 00:13:32,040
Jika perintah untuk menyimpan limbah ini
di Goiás datang dari pusat,

181
00:13:32,041 --> 00:13:34,000
kau takkan punya pilihan.

182
00:13:34,916 --> 00:13:37,541
Ya. Kau bisa bicara
dengan Presiden, Roberto.

183
00:13:45,083 --> 00:13:48,000
CNEN punya kontak di Kongres, 'kan?

184
00:13:48,583 --> 00:13:49,458
Ya.

185
00:13:52,166 --> 00:13:55,083
Bisa kau tangani di sana?

186
00:13:55,583 --> 00:13:57,791
Tentu. Aku bisa segera memulainya.

187
00:13:58,791 --> 00:13:59,625
Baiklah,

188
00:14:00,625 --> 00:14:02,790
dengan dukungan Presiden dan Kongres,

189
00:14:02,791 --> 00:14:06,999
kita tak perlu menunggu UU disahkan
untuk membangun tempat penyimpanan.

190
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:10,583
Tapi kita umumkan sebagai tempat sementara
untuk menghindari kehebohan.

191
00:14:26,208 --> 00:14:27,416
Aku ingin menemuimu.

192
00:14:28,791 --> 00:14:29,791
Bicara padamu.

193
00:14:33,291 --> 00:14:36,708
Aku ingin membacakan sesuatu yang kutulis.

194
00:14:40,250 --> 00:14:41,125
Boleh?

195
00:14:43,208 --> 00:14:44,125
Ini dia…

196
00:14:49,458 --> 00:14:52,625
"Cintaku kini hidup dalam keheningan.

197
00:14:56,333 --> 00:14:58,416
Mereka bilang dia telah jadi kenangan.

198
00:15:00,791 --> 00:15:02,375
Bintang di langit.

199
00:15:05,333 --> 00:15:06,333
Pahlawan.

200
00:15:10,125 --> 00:15:12,458
Aku hanya ingin dia hidup."

201
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:20,000
Yang sebenarnya kuinginkan adalah

202
00:15:21,416 --> 00:15:23,541
Tininha dan Celeste

203
00:15:25,166 --> 00:15:27,332
bernyanyi dan menari
di halaman belakang kami,

204
00:15:27,333 --> 00:15:28,625
tapi tidak, 'kan?

205
00:15:29,958 --> 00:15:30,791
Tidak.

206
00:15:33,791 --> 00:15:38,750
Yang sebenarnya ingin kutulis,
tapi tak bisa, setelah semua tragedi ini

207
00:15:40,458 --> 00:15:43,083
adalah tak ada hari yang berlalu
tanpa aku berpikir…

208
00:15:45,916 --> 00:15:47,791
andai saja aku tak membeli

209
00:15:49,166 --> 00:15:51,583
kotak bekal sialan itu…

210
00:15:53,750 --> 00:15:55,458
kotak bekal terkutuk itu…

211
00:15:58,666 --> 00:16:00,958
semua ini takkan terjadi, 'kan?

212
00:16:03,583 --> 00:16:05,750
Astaga, aku…

213
00:16:06,250 --> 00:16:07,416
Aku mengacau.

214
00:16:08,208 --> 00:16:09,250
Aku…

215
00:16:09,916 --> 00:16:12,333
Aku benar-benar mengacau, João. Sialan…

216
00:16:14,375 --> 00:16:15,208
Aku…

217
00:16:20,541 --> 00:16:21,833
Aku tahu…

218
00:16:23,916 --> 00:16:27,415
kau tak wajib memaafkanku, tapi, kau tahu…

219
00:16:27,416 --> 00:16:28,958
Kau tahu, Kawan, aku…

220
00:16:31,250 --> 00:16:33,541
Aku akan tetap minta maaf, oke?

221
00:16:35,500 --> 00:16:37,375
Aku minta maaf, João.

222
00:16:37,958 --> 00:16:39,125
Aku minta maaf.

223
00:16:41,875 --> 00:16:45,750
Tapi menurutku
kau juga tak boleh seperti ini.

224
00:16:46,791 --> 00:16:48,000
Terpuruk.

225
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,125
Menyerah.

226
00:16:50,625 --> 00:16:52,957
Kau harus sembuh, João.

227
00:16:52,958 --> 00:16:53,875
Kawan…

228
00:16:55,916 --> 00:16:58,041
Kau harus melawan balik. Sialan!

229
00:17:03,666 --> 00:17:04,500
Aku…

230
00:17:06,583 --> 00:17:10,333
Aku tak tahu
apakah diriku sanggup kehilanganmu juga.

231
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:15,125
Aku tak sanggup.

232
00:17:20,208 --> 00:17:21,750
Aku minta maaf, Kawan.

233
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:23,750
Maafkan aku.

234
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:38,332
- César.
- Apa kabar?

235
